<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Task>
    <Title>Uninstall Tivoli Endpoint Manager Client - 32 bit</Title>
    <Description>
    Standard Uninstallation Fixlet Template.  See the Uninstall Wizard for details related to this fixlet. 
    &lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Source Wizard:&lt;/B&gt; &lt;A href=&quot;http://bigfix.me/uninstall&quot;&gt;http://bigfix.me/uninstall&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
    &lt;P&gt;This fixlet is constructed from the following variables provided by the developer:&lt;/P&gt;
    &lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Registry Source:&lt;/B&gt; HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall&lt;/P&gt;
    &lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Display Name:&lt;/B&gt; Tivoli Endpoint Manager Client&lt;/P&gt;
    &lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Application Guid:&lt;/B&gt; 64A3A4F4-B792-11D6-A78A-00B0D0170450&lt;/P&gt;
    &lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Uninstall Command String:&lt;/B&gt; msiexec.exe /x{appGuid} /quiet /norestart&lt;/P&gt;
</Description>
    <Relevance>name of operating system starts with &quot;Win&quot;</Relevance>
    <Relevance>if exists property &quot;in proxy agent context&quot; then ( not in proxy agent context ) else true</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists key whose (value &quot;DisplayName&quot; of it as string contains &quot;Tivoli Endpoint Manager Client&quot; AND value &quot;UninstallString&quot; of it as string as lowercase contains &quot;msiexec&quot;) of key &quot;HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall&quot; of registry</Relevance>
    <Category>Uninstall</Category>
    <Source>Froses</Source>
    <SourceID>&lt;Unspecified&gt;</SourceID>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2015-03-19</SourceReleaseDate>
    <SourceSeverity>&lt;Unspecified&gt;</SourceSeverity>
    <MIMEField>
      <Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
      <Value>Thu, 19 Mar 2015 05:20:400</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink>Click </PreLink>
        <Link>here</Link>
        <PostLink> to uninstall this software.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell">
//User Defined Uninstall String
waithidden msiexec.exe /x{{64A3A4F4-B792-11D6-A78A-00B0D0170450} /quiet /norestart
    </ActionScript>
      <SuccessCriteria Option="OriginalRelevance"></SuccessCriteria>
    </DefaultAction>
    <Action ID="Action956">
